CubeOS fonts
============

cube-6x9 and cube-5x7: X11 "misc-fixed" fonts from the UCS fonts collection by Markus Kuhn
(https://www.cl.cam.ac.uk/~mgk25/ucs-fonts.html). The collection is released into the public domain.

cube-8x16: Spleen by Frederic Cambus (https://github.com/fcambus/spleen), BSD 2-Clause license below.
The Ukrainian Ye (U+0404, U+0454) of cube-8x16 was added by the CubeOS project.

